  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, ginger, and garlic; cook, stirring occasionally, until onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add red pepper flakes, cumin, and berbere spice; cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add chickpeas, broth, and tomato paste; bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, until stew has thickened and flavors have melded, about 30 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste."
